---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="shell footer-lead">
    <span class="section-label">Let’s keep learning</span>
    <h2>Good engineering grows when we share the reasoning.</h2>
    <div class="footer-actions">
      <a href={`${base}articles/`} class="button button-light">Browse the writing <span>→</span></a>
      <a href={`${base}subscribe/`} class="text-button">Follow the journey ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="shell footer-grid">
    <div>
      <a class="brand footer-brand" href={base}>
        <span class="brand-monogram" aria-hidden="true">&lt;S/&gt;</span>
        <span class="brand-copy"><strong>Surya Tech Codex</strong><small>Code smarter. Grow faster.</small></span>
      </a>
      <p>Practical notes on .NET, Azure, AI architecture, career growth, and building products that help people.</p>
    </div>
    <div><h3>Explore</h3><a href={`${base}articles/`}>Articles</a><a href={`${base}training/`}>Training</a><a href={`${base}projects/`}>Projects</a><a href={`${base}career/`}>Career</a><a href={`${base}about/`}>About</a></div>
    <div><h3>More</h3><a href={`${base}community/`}>Community</a><a href={`${base}thoughts/`}>Thoughts</a><a href={`${base}rss.xml`}>RSS feed</a><a href="https://suryabest.wordpress.com/">Archive</a></div>
    <div><h3>Connect</h3><a href="https://github.com/surya99" rel="me">GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/suryarock/" rel="me">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="https://suryakant-portfolio.vercel.app/">Portfolio ↗</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="shell footer-bottom">
    <span>© {year} Surya Tech Codex. All rights reserved.</span>
    <span class="footer-legal"><a href={`${base}privacy/`}>Privacy</a><a href={`${base}terms/`}>Terms</a><button type="button" data-open-consent>Cookie preferences</button></span>
    <span>Designed, developed and maintained by <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/suryarock/" rel="author">Suryakant</a>.</span>
  </div>
</footer>
